config REALTEK_DISPLAY_ENABLE_JPU
    bool "Enable Realtek JPU (JPEG hardware codec)"
    default n
    help
        Driver for the Realtek JPU JPEG codec IP. A different IP from the
        VeriSilicon VC9000DJ DecoderJ, sharing no register or clock code with it.

        The driver still targets the Realtek RTOS SDK: it includes rtl876x.h,
        address_map.h, os_mem.h and trace.h, none of which exist in this
        RT-Thread workspace. Turning this on will therefore fail to compile until
        an RT-Thread platform layer is added, the way vcdj has one under
        src/device/rtl87x3k_rtt/.

        This is the driver's only build-time option.
